# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Zhenxing Dai et al. (2026). Small-supercell and Small-dataset Training Strategy of Machine Learning Interatomic Potentials for Point Defects.
#   arXiv (Cornell University). doi:10.48550/arxiv.2609.24293  arXiv:2609.24293v1
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2609.24293v1 (sha256 76a9ce3a89463d3f...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 461 (Dataset/benchmark). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/dai2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: one from-scratch Allegro model per defect and charge
# state, trained on configurations from DFT relaxation trajectories in
# small supercells (15-95 atoms), with the Defect-Only and Defect+Host
# (adding size-matched pristine bulk) schemes for charged defects. Each
# run here is the largest training set of its table; the smaller
# incremental training sets are not separate runs. Evaluation is by
# total-energy error and RMSD of single relaxed structures in larger
# supercells, which are not MAE/RMSE metrics.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-dai2026 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Dai et al. (2026): small-supercell, small-dataset Allegro training for neutral and charged point defects in GaN, SiO2 and Cu2ZnSnS4" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-dai2026 .

